---
import SectionIndex from './SectionIndex.astro';
---

<section class="collection-section reveal" id="collection" aria-labelledby="collection-title">
  <SectionIndex number="02" label="THE COLLECTION" />
  <div class="collection-content">
    <div class="collection-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted">A collection in the making</p>
        <h2 id="collection-title">Made for your<br /><em>everyday.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="collection-aside">Each Orivelle app starts with one question: can this be simpler, calmer, more useful?</p>
    </div>
    <article class="collection-card">
      <div class="card-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="visual-window">
          <div class="window-top"><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-title">orivelle / concept</span><span class="window-menu">•••</span></div>
          <div class="window-body"><div class="window-sidebar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="window-main"><span class="window-kicker">A PLACE TO BEGIN</span><span class="window-heading">Make space<br />for the work.</span><span class="window-pill">YOUR NEXT IDEA <b>↗</b></span><div class="window-line"></div><div class="window-line short"></div></div><div class="window-ambient"></div></div>
        </div>
        <span class="visual-caption">Concept / desktop experience <span>01 / 01</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <div class="card-topline"><span>ORIVELLE SOFTWARE</span><span class="card-status">COLLECTION / OVERVIEW</span></div>
        <div class="card-main"><div><h3>Thoughtful desktop apps.</h3><p>Focused software for Windows and Linux, shaped around clarity and everyday use. Find each app’s details, platform information, and download here.</p></div><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
        <div class="card-footer"><span>DESKTOP APPLICATIONS</span><div><span class="platform-chip"><span class="windows-icon" aria-hidden="true">⊞</span> Windows</span><span class="platform-chip"><span class="linux-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</span> Linux</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <p class="collection-note"><span class="note-star">✳</span> New releases will appear here, with everything you need to get started.</p>
  </div>
</section>
